[I] Micro Tetris, based on 1989 IOCCC Obfuscated Tetris

[T] Micro Tetris is one of the smallest Tetris implementations, based on the
[T] 1989 IOCCC obfuscated Tetris entry. It draws the board with ANSI escape
[T] sequences only and needs nothing but a standard C library, making it
[T] suitable for embedded devices.

[U] https://github.com/troglobit/tetris

[A] Micro-tetris Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

